{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Judgement is a detective adventure game where the story progresses as you follow the quest.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the detective Cain who lost his memory and travel around each city to solve the case and reach the truth of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Synopsis]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sephioth, a countury combined with 12 cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You make own detective office in small town where called Aport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases occurred in each cities, you should solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the request and solve the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855480/extras/25f942027621b9b752717fe6c15696ee.avif?t=1759237800\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, and the main character of this story. You are a rookie detective in Aport. No matter how difficult the case is, you will solve it with your exceptional intelligence. However, you\u2019re torched by a headache after your memory loss. How can you be freed from this pain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855480/extras/92cbb72e2e9464aca9adfe4837fb8289.avif?t=1759237800\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unidentified man. You asked for him to be your investigation partner, he accepted it. Now he lives with you in your office, he is very helpful with cooking, gardening, cleaning\u2026 He assists you from up close. Maybe he will be a good friend with you. But sometimes you see his cold face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Play]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855480/extras/bd27575ab179bc81145ad3c809b0da58.avif?t=1759237800\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and get clues in a crime scene placed in a beautiful and featured city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet variable suspects. Get information from them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective show</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the right choice to get closer to the truth of the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persuade people with clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct articles with informations which you have.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before next chapter starts, you can move around in peaceful city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In changing weathers and times, find hidden sub quests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hanging out</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Give presents for attractive npcs, and listen to their stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855480?t=1759237800","background_raw"